msgid "Our apologies for the annoyance :("
msgstr ""

#: ../lib/GalettePaypal/Controllers/PaypalController.php:89
msgid ""
"Paypal id has not been defined. Please ask an administrator to add it from "
"plugin preferences."
msgstr ""
"L'identificador de Paypal no s'ha definit. Si us plau, demaneu a un "
"administrador que l'afegeixi des de les preferències del connector."

